{"4371860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Killware: Under Review", "steam_appid": 4371860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4757590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killware: Under Review is an ultra-gory top-down arcade shooter. Survive long enough to meet the time requirement and unlock brutal new stages, starting with just a pistol and your fists. Play it safe, or dare the authorities to unleash more severe compliance tools upon you, if you're brave enough to climb <strong>Heat</strong> levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371860/extras/87e62b7327ebab17ee61cbb8adedb058.poster.avif?t=1781419552\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371860/extras/87e62b7327ebab17ee61cbb8adedb058.webm?t=1781419552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371860/extras/87e62b7327ebab17ee61cbb8adedb058.mp4?t=1781419552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super-satisfying <strong>gore</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random</strong> weapon drops (melee and ranged)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience level <strong>progression</strong> (Career mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Killstreaks</strong> and <strong>Heat Levels</strong> with enemy types that ramp up in difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable powers</strong> and random <strong>ability powerups</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dystopian future, the Content Compliance Police (CCP) decide what